# Detection request to the DetectorNode (yolo container).
#
# The image can be the full image or a crop — the service makes no
# difference, it processes whatever it receives. The ROI logic
# (computing the crop, translating the coordinates) lives in demo_package,
# not here.

sensor_msgs/Image image

# If empty, the node uses the configured default classes (ROS 2 parameter
# default_classes).
string[] target_classes

# If True, the internal tracker (BoT-SORT, state kept across consecutive
# calls) is reset BEFORE processing this request — use it when starting
# from scratch (e.g. tracking_fsm goes back to SEARCH after losing the
# target), so that an old track_id does not resurface in a new session.
bool reset_tracker false

---

BoxDetection[] detections
